Yoram

This product is an independent Rust + React port of legacy Yona:
https://github.com/yona-projects/yona

Yona is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Upstream attribution
belongs to the Yona authors and contributors, including NAVER Corp. and NAVER
LABS as identified by the upstream project.

Yoram is not affiliated with NAVER, NAVER LABS, or the Yona project. The Yona
name is used only to describe the upstream project, preserve migration
compatibility, and document legacy parity behavior.

Do not reuse upstream Yona logos, icons, screenshots, or CI imagery as Yoram
release assets unless their license and attribution are reviewed separately.
